fix:
Read the inherited theme by reference and only build a default when absent, so the whole ComponentThemeData (with its style and text_style payloads) is not cloned on every build:
    let default = ComponentThemeData::default();
    let inherited = inherited.unwrap_or(&default);
All later field reads (Option<Size>, Option<Color>) are Copy and work unchanged through the reference.
